= International

Now that we joined the International, they might serve us or we might serve them...

WIP

- @closer: Make closer relations with the International.
- @distance: Attemt to distance ourselvs from the organisation.
- @relations: Use the International to increse our relations with <span style="color: #ffa300;">Vyliria</span> and other <span style="color: #d61818;">Socialismt/span> partners. 
- @rally: We can use the International as a strong rallying cry for our campian. 
- @support: We can ask the International for economic support...
- @support_rev: Internationale is willing to give us revolutionary support.
- @advisors: The Internationale offers sending their advisors 
- @easy_discard

@closer
on-arrival: internationale_relations += 2; internationale_dependence += 1; radicalization += 1 if internationale_policy = 1; pacifism += 1 if internationale_policy = 2;

